      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STORM BREWING (5) was big odds last time but gave a huge sight after a fast early split and ran away with a 3 length win at this track over 400m in 22.77. Great chance again. BULL DURHAM (4) turned in a moderate effort last time when eighth at Geelong over 400m behind Rocky Superstar (23.57) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. One of the main contenders. DREAM ON ALLAN (1) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth at this track, but was among the placings at this track three back. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. DO SOMETHING (2) deserves plenty of thought over this trip.",
